{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1064376/block/singleImage/3270603/df/1616334866_uH.jpg?updatedAt=1794973901\"/><figcaption>中環滙豐銀行總行大廈。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>中環皇后大道中滙豐銀行總行，周二（11月17日）下午3時許有職員報案，有兩名顧客出示懷疑虛假文書以開立戶口。警員接報到場，經初步調查，52歲姓邢男子及53歲姓金女子，向銀行職員提供一張由滙豐銀行發出總值2000億港幣的月結單。兩人涉嫌「行使虛假文書」被拘捕扣查。目前案件由中區刑事調查隊第三隊跟進。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T04:45:38.192307+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":167,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T03:51:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T20:57:40.463665+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T04:38:55.553428+00:00","content_hash":"d659c1fc5188bcb881705228e17853b5adb3a95cf0b51d1e7ded21f8c8abf525","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-18T04:45:38.192307+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}